WEBVTT

00:27:56.579 --> 00:28:01.121
It doesn't always obviously get better.
I think what is true is.

00:28:02.496 --> 00:28:06.163
Every technological revolution
produces a change in jobs,

00:28:06.579 --> 00:28:09.371
we always find new ones, at least so far.

00:28:09.621 --> 00:28:12.871
It's difficult to predict from
where we're sitting now what

00:28:12.871 --> 00:28:18.413
the new ones will be and this
technological revolution is likely to be.

00:28:18.663 --> 00:28:20.746
Again, it's always tempting to
say this time it's different.

00:28:20.746 --> 00:28:21.788
Maybe I'll be totally wrong.

00:28:21.788 --> 00:28:25.996
But from what I see now, this
technological revolution is likely to be

00:28:25.996 --> 00:28:32.954
more. Dramatic. More of a
staccato note than most,